<div class="wrap"><div class="ledger">
 <div><b>00</b><small>chaves de API</small><svg class="rabisco" viewBox="0 0 34 18"><path d="M1 14c8-12 20 8 32-10" fill="none" stroke="#c68b2c" stroke-width="1.1"/></svg></div>
 <div><b>26</b><small>chats catalogados</small></div>
